        "wordAbsenceReason": "The DOCX introduces the wetland and lists activities within the daily itinerary, but it has no standalone overview combining the habitat and the three ways of exploring it."
      },
      "text": "The Pantanal stretches across a vast wetland in central South America and is one of Brazil’s main natural regions. Its lakes, rivers, grasslands and riverside forests are home to many birds, mammals and reptiles. Over four days, you explore this landscape from the water, on horseback and on a 4x4 safari."
